        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n27",
        "exercise": "516",
        "text": "计算：\n1) $208.57-108.57:[(60.4-57.6)\\cdot(3.6+3.45)]$；\n2) $565.3-465.3:[(1.25+5.8)\\cdot(55.8-49.2)]$."
      }
